WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.100
Edit the published form
This editor controls the apprenticeship enrolment wizard. Work on a draft copy of the published layout. Changes reach learners when you publish.

2
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:16.700
Organise steps and questions
Select a step to review its questions and content. Use the available ordering and editing controls. Some built-in items have restrictions.

3
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:24.100
Configure form fields
Add supported custom fields, edit labels and text, and choose optional or mandatory where available. Check conditional questions and their dependencies.

4
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:31.769
Review before publishing
Review the draft and the publish confirmation carefully. Publishing affects the shared form. Removing a published field hides it while preserving its stored answers.
